Source: pg-checksums
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/credativ/pg_checksums

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-checksums
Architecture: any
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Check and manage PostgreSQL data checksums
 The pg_checksums_ext utility checks, enables and disables PostgreSQL data checksums.
